title: Apply for a single person discount on your council tax
---
<h1>Apply for a single person discount on your council tax</h1>

<p>If you're the only adult living in your home, you can get 25% off your council tax bill.</p>

<p>An adult is anyone aged 18 or over. Some adults aren't counted for council tax, for example full-time students. If you live with someone like this, you might get a different discount instead.</p>

<h2>Before you start</h2>
<p>You'll need:</p>
<ul class="p-list">
  <li>the date you became the only adult living in your home</li>
  <li>the new address of anyone who moved out, if you know it</li>
  <li>your council tax account number, if you have it (it's on your bill)</li>
</ul>

<p>It takes about 5 minutes.</p>

